    "title": "商品批量导入",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<h2 id=\"%E6%89%B9%E9%87%8F%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E5%95%86%E5%93%81\" tabindex=\"-1\">批量导入新增商品<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E6%89%B9%E9%87%8F%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E5%95%86%E5%93%81\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p><video src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202503/ce4a49c8bc3dabd31c9e52b2351fc5ba.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" class=\"my-video\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n\n\n视频描述\n</video></p>\n<h3 id=\"%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF\" tabindex=\"-1\">业务场景<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h3>\n<p>软件初始用建立货品基础资料，需要新增大量的货品资料，可以利用Excel表格快速导入新货品。</p>\n<h3 id=\"%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E\" tabindex=\"-1\">功能说明<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h3>\n<p>1、快速导入时，请先下载商品资料导入模板。</p>\n<p>2、不支持批量导入商品图片。</p>\n<p>3、EXCEL表格文件需要关闭后再上传，才能导入成功。</p>\n<h3 id=\"%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84\" tabindex=\"-1\">操作路径<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h3>\n<p>【商品】-【商品】-【导入新增】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202511/75046d2f14314d40c9197531e3eea71d.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"%E4%B8%8B%E8%BD%BD%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF\" tabindex=\"-1\">下载商品资料导入模板<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E4%B8%8B%E8%BD%BD%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202511/6077cfb2bc995fdf3c78624a0f6bcb7e.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>选择商品类型</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>简单商品：适用于没有规格或单规格的商品信息录入</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>多规格商品：适用于有多规格(如颜色，尺码)的商品</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202511/78d1ffec0cbc12349032616a49424292.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>设置需要哪些商品信息\n<img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202511/6967517a54c80bd135c0b504bd472dd2.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>点击下载模板，在模板文件中填写要导入的商品信息，保存</p>\n<p><strong>注意：请勿修改表头和文件格式</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202511/e2d1fb21a35fa9fa12c73408607e8194.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC\" tabindex=\"-1\">上传表格<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h3>\n<p>点击上传文件，选择填写好的模板文件，进行导入\n<img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202511/939306039d07df20ccf7c390becf80ce.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C\" tabindex=\"-1\">查看导入结果<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h3>\n<h4>导入失败</h4>\n<p>若导入失败，可下载失败数据，根据“错误原因”提示，调整导入模板中填写的内容后重新上传</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202511/f8cbfeab960e7267bbb8ac5dcc194649.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202511/8e845e2e5f55bb699f249b173f980c0e.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h4>导入成功</h4>\n<p>若全部导入成功，则商品导入已完成。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202511/32b8d452f8a8a4e94b3e5cb959dfe537.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n",
